    {
      "id": "design-notes",
      "name": "Design Notes",
      "type": "note",
      "x": 6280, "y": 0,
      "width": 400, "height": 1300,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": "Source Code Pro",
      "content": "DESIGN REFERENCE NOTES\n========================\n\nDesign pattern: HuggingFace.co\n- Public homepage = hero + trending + features\n- Logged-in = dashboard with personal feed\n- Same nav bar, login becomes avatar\n\nContent source: sdsc-hackathons.ch\n- Hackathon events (ORD, GenAI, Climate)\n- Temporal framework (T-4 to post-event)\n- Registration -> proposals -> teams -> hack\n\nTheme: Hackathonsdsc\n- Monospace font (Source Code Pro)\n- Border radius: 0 (sharp corners)\n- Primary: #6ABF4B (green)\n- Secondary: #5A4D8A (purple)\n- Dark mode default\n\nFrames (left to right):\n1. / = Public homepage (1440px)\n2. /welcome = Dashboard (1440px)\n3. /hackathon/[slug] = Detail page (1440px)\n4. /hackathon/[slug] = Logged-in (1440px)\n\n========================\nHOMEPAGE\n========================\nHF patterns adopted:\n1. Clean centered hero, no heavy bg\n2. Tabbed trending list (not card grid)\n3. Winner showcase cards\n4. 2x2 feature grid\n5. Org logos as social proof\n6. Horizontal CTA banner\n\nConfluence req coverage:\n[x] Current Hackathons/Challenges\n[x] Project & team winners\n[x] Latest Hackathons (in tabs)\n[x] Invitation to register\n[x] Organize your hackathon CTA\n\n========================\nDASHBOARD (/welcome)\n========================\n[x] Active hackathon status + phase\n[x] Current project/team\n[x] Past hackathons & teams\n[x] Notification center\n[x] Settings link\n\n========================\nHACKATHON PAGE (PUBLIC)\n========================\nModular sections (Confluence 7.3):\nAll toggleable by organizer.\n\nSection 1: Hero\n  [x] Title (string)\n  [x] Dates (string)\n  [x] Venue (string)\n  [x] Main photo (url) — gradient bg\n\nSection 2: Organizers\n  [x] Description (string)\n  [x] Logos (list of picture URL)\n\nSection 3: Markdown\n  [x] Markdown formatted text\n  [x] Bold, lists, links, pictures\n\nSection 4: Support Events\n  [x] Titles (list of webinars)\n  [x] Speakers / logos (pictures)\n  [x] Link to more info\n\nSection 5: Highlights\n  [x] Picture (one per block)\n  [x] Message (one per block)\n\nSection 6: Video\n  [x] Title\n  [x] Caption\n  [x] Video url\n\nSection 7: Call to Action\n  [x] Button (link to registration)\n\n========================\nHACKATHON — LOGGED IN\n========================\nFigma ref (functional requirements only):\neUBPuQj0KlWAzIfKEgqpHY\n\nFunctionality extracted from existing site:\n\nNAVIGATION (sub-pages):\n[x] Overview / Home\n[x] All participants list\n[x] Project proposals list\n[x] All teams list\n[x] Submitted projects\n[x] Timeline & Agenda\n[x] Webinars\n[x] Photos\n→ Implemented as horizontal tabs\n  (not old sidebar)\n\nPHASE AWARENESS:\n[x] Phase timeline bar with states:\n    completed / active / upcoming\n[x] From data model: Phase entity\n    (id, hackathon_id, start/end, name)\n[x] Phase-aware CTAs change per step\n\nPARTICIPATION STATUS:\n[x] Registration badge\n[x] Team assignment (name, members)\n[x] Project info (title, track, status)\n[x] Next action CTA with deadline\n→ Maps to: Participant, Team,\n  TeamParticipant, Submission entities\n\nUSER ACTIONS (phase-aware):\n[x] Propose a project\n[x] Set preferences / choose prefs\n[x] Submit project\n[x] Vote for best project\n[x] View profile\n[x] Account settings\n→ Active vs disabled based on phase\n\nTEAM MANAGEMENT:\n[x] Team name + description\n[x] Member list with avatars\n[x] Member roles (owner/member)\n[x] View team page link\n→ Maps to: Team, TeamParticipant\n\nADMIN TOOLS (role-gated):\n[x] Create Hackathon\n[x] Create Team\n[x] Manage Users\n[x] Manage Projects\n[x] Manage Teams\n[x] Manage Votes\n[x] Manage Hackathons\n→ Only shown if User.role = admin\n\nUSEFUL LINKS:\n[x] Previous Hackathons\n[x] About SDSC\n[x] Contact us\n[x] Why Participate?\n\nDATA MODEL coverage:\n[x] User (profile, role, skills)\n[x] Hackathon (name, dates, visibility)\n[x] Participant (registration, waiting)\n[x] Team (name, desc, category, status)\n[x] TeamParticipant (role)\n[x] Submission (status)\n[x] Phase (timeline)\n[x] Category (tracks)\n[x] Vote (best project)\n[x] Page (content sections)\n[x] Settings (max participants, etc.)\n\nSkeleton mapping:\n- Tabs: tab-group / custom flex\n- Phase bar: stepper / custom flex\n- Participation card: card + badge\n- Action buttons: btn preset-filled\n- Team card: card + Avatar\n- Admin links: nav-list or link list\n- Icons: lucide-svelte throughout"
    }
  ]
}
